script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;FC DF A6 04;I'm going to give you a quest that says, "Fight Me,"\nso go ahead and accept it!
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;BE 0C 06 0D;The Vanguard Promotion Association—commonly known as FIVA—is an organization that supports us\nfighters in various ways.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;31 E6 18 11;As you move up in rank, you'll get all kinds of perks,|and you'll also qualify to participate in tournaments.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;D3 18 FC 25;I got the VP.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;6B 6E E4 2D;Oh, right—I'll give you this while I still remember. \nIt's a Fighters card, commonly known as a "Fika."
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;92 01 2A 2E;I\ngot it.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;15 57 66 3A;Now I'm ready to fight anytime!
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;31 74 12 3D;I received a PR card.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;E8 7F 3A 4B;The biggest highlight is the VG Network!
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;CC BA 01 51;Oh, and I'll do this, too. Give it a try.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;C9 82 1E 51;Well, just explaining it probably won't make it clear. \nLet's try doing a quest, shall we?
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;66 C4 4B 64;Huh?\nWhat is the “Vanguard Promotion Association”?
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;7D 99 69 6E;If you complete the quests available here, \nyou can raise your grade. 
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;D5 79 FC 6F;Avatar
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;28 AC 4E 78;It's published by the "Vanguard Promotion Association,"\nso it's kind of like a fighter's badge.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;78 6D B7 8E;I've earned a new title.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;54 6C C3 A2;○○
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;98 DB 3A DC;I got \n.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;79 4B 3F EF;I got some CP.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;F0 9F 4A F7;By the way, since you've just started,\nyour grade is 0 and your color is white.
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;EC F5 62 F9;Well then, here’s a little something from me—\na pack as a gift!
script/EV_G_04.bin;0x543F;AE A0 88 FC;All right, it's settled!\nFrom now on, this trial deck is yours.
